eenshot of each action mentioned above and upload them to your storage drive. Then, copy the link and paste it into the input forms provided above. Ensure that the folder is accessible to the public and not private.</p>";s:17:"confirmation_desc";s:1550:"<h1>Korea Youth Summit 2025</h1><p>The Korea Youth Summit offers both <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Fully Funded</strong> and <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Self-Funded</strong> opportunities. To qualify for <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Full Funding</strong>, delegates must complete all registration steps and meet the payment deadline. If not selected for Full Funding, delegates can still participate through the self-funded scheme.</p><p>The comprehensive expenses outlined in the Korea Youth Summit payment cover accommodation throughout the program (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">June 30 - July 03, 2025</strong>), including airport transfers on the first day (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">June 30, 2025</strong>, from the airport to the hotel) and the last day of the program (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">July 03, 2025</strong>, from the hotel to the airport). Please note that all fully funded and self-funded payments do not include flight tickets or visa expenses. Fully funded spots will be awarded based on the quality of applicants.</p><p>Let’s join hands and collaborate at the Korea Youth Summit 2025. Your involvement is <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">essential</strong> for a powerful and <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">meaningful</strong> experience.</p><p class="ql-align-center"><em>I am </em><strong><em>ready</em></strong><em> to join the Korea Youth Summit 2025 in </em><strong><em>Seoul, South Korea</em></strong><em>.</em></p>";s:9:"is_active";s:1:"1";s:20:"is_registration_open";s:1:"0";s:10:"is_deleted";s:1:"0";s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2025-07-16 20:29:22";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2025-07-17 13:45:36";s:7:"web_url";s:20:"koreayouthsummit.com";s:8:"logo_url";s:46:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/logo/KYS.png";}i:1;a:24:{s:2:"id";s:1:"8";s:19:"program_category_id";s:1:"3";s:4:"name";s:29:"Middle East Youth Summit 2025";s:10:"banner_url";s:73:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/programs/8/images/banner_1748458692.jpg";s:11:"description";s:2048:"<p class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">MEYS MAIN THEME</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Empowering Emerging Leaders for Positive Change within the Islamic Brotherhood</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">SUBTHEMES</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">SDG 4 – Quality Education</strong></li></ul><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">To provide inclusive and equitable education that equips youth with skills, knowledge, and values for leadership.</span></p><ul><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">SDG 5 – Gender Equality</strong></li></ul><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">To ensure equal opportunities for young Muslim women and men to lead and contribute meaningfully to society.</span></p><ul><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">SDG 10 – Reduced Inequality</strong></li></ul><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">To empower marginalized youth and reduce socio-economic disparities within the Muslim community.</span></p><ul><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">SDG 16 – Peace, Justice, and Strong Institutions</strong></li></ul><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">To cultivate active youth leaders committed to justice, transparency, and peaceful civic engagement.</span></p><ul><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">SDG 17 – Partnerships for the Goals</strong></li></ul><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">To strengthen intergenerational and cross-border collaborations for sustainable impact within the Islamic world.</span></p><p><br></p>";s:9:"guideline";s:33:"https://bit.ly/GuidelineMEYS2025 ";s:19:"main_essay_question";s:115:"How can Muslims contribute to building a just, inclusive, and sustainable society despite the challenges they face?";s:19:"essay_guideline_url";s:26:"https://bit.ly/MEYS25Essay";s:7:"twibbon";s:24:"https://twibbo.nz/meys25";s:17:"twibbon_video_url";s:42:"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Q037C9IP9FU";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-12-01 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-12-04 00:00:00";s:22:"registration_video_url";s:31:"https://bit.ly/tutorialMEYS2025";s:16:"tshirt_chart_url";s:64:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/general-files/tshirt_chart.jpg";s:5:"theme";s:78:"Empowering Emerging Leaders for Positive Change within the Islamic Brotherhood";s:10:"share_desc";s:2396:"<p><strong>Note</strong>: As mentioned in the Registration Guidelines, you need to complete the following steps:</p><ul><li>Follow our TikTok and Instagram accounts:<span style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"> </span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/youthbreaktheboundaries/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>Youth Break the Boundaries Instagram</strong></a><strong>,</strong><span style="color: rgb(204, 224, 245);"> </span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/meysummit/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>Middle East Youth Summit Instagram</strong></a>, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>Youth Break the Boundaries TikTok</strong></a>, <a href="https://www.tikto